# Delivery

- MVP: direct Docker Compose deploy to server — CI/CD deferred (ADR-0016).
- Pin runtime versions; multi-stage builds; non-root; read-only FS where practical.
- Config externalized and startup-validated; secrets never in images/git.
- Order: migrate job (advisory lock) → API/Studio/worker.
- Readiness vs liveness; graceful shutdown preserves safe redelivery.
- Backup Postgres + blobs + encrypted config to another failure domain.
- Homelab may certify; Hostinger VPS is MVP production target — same digest when promoting.
- Do not merge `.env` secrets, build outputs, or personal test data.
